sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Activity / Filament
    participant H as AdminPublicationHistory
    participant V as PublicationVersionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GC as PublicationMediaCleanupService
    participant A as AdminAuditService
    participant N as AdminNotifier
    UI->>H: can_revert (LIVE + restorable Parent)
    alt Kein LIVE, Parent oder kompatibler Snapshot
        H-->>UI: Warnung, keine Mutation
    else Revert erlaubt
        UI->>V: stageRevertOfCurrent(actor)
        V->>DB: aktuellen LIVE-Checkpoint und Parent lesen
        V->>DB: BEGIN + Advisory Lock + Schema-Paritaet
        V->>V: assertRestorable(parent)
        V->>GC: queueAbandonedWorkingMedia
        V->>DB: Working durch Parent-Snapshot ersetzen
        V->>DB: workingContext = revert + aktuelle LIVE-ID
        V->>A: publication.commit_revert_staged
        DB-->>V: COMMIT
        V->>GC: drain nach Commit
        UI->>N: Commit revert staged (success)
        Note over UI,DB: Kein historischer Checkpoint wird geloescht
        Note over UI,DB: Erst neuer Commit publiziert den Parent-Zustand
    end
